{"version":1,"content":"<p>由盧慧敏（Amy）﹑龔慈恩（龔姐）及盧鎮業（小野），聯同魯文傑、劉煒燿、莫鎮彤合演的浪漫喜劇《婚後赤腳遊》，將於12月18日起假香港藝術中心壽臣劇院上演，合共演出10場。</p><p>門票將於明天（10月30日）中午12時開始於撲飛POPTICKET優先訂票；</p><p>11月2日中午12時公開發售。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:41:32.721096+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:25:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.565898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:14.605467+00:00","content_hash":"825a9e722f714a08ea03742cfb4d4974279796d23c7d06de9ec84f37f0446fc1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}